# B. Give Credit – Always

You are **required** to give proper and visible credit wherever and however you use this code. That means:

* You keep any references to “XKITZ” intact.
* You **don’t remove this license** from any distribution or file set.
* You **clearly acknowledge** that this code was created by me, XKITZ.
* If you post or show off work based on this, include a link to the original repo.

No silent edits, no stripping my name off the code headers, no “found this online” vague citations. If you can copy the code, you can copy the credit.

