# C. You Cannot Modify or Remix

This is **not open-source in the remix sense**. You are **not allowed** to:

* Fork this code into a new project and call it your own.
* Modify it, even if you credit me.
* Add new features, strip out features, or repackage it with “improvements.”
* Use it as a base or template for your own application, game, tool, or website.
* Publish a “fixed” or “optimized” version.

You can run it. You can look at it. But you **cannot change it** and redistribute it in any form – even for free.

This protects the integrity of the original work and keeps people from diluting or misrepresenting what this code is supposed to be.

IF you really want to fix or optimize it, just contact me privately and i will fix it and release a new fixed and optimized version of the script.

